            <div xml:id="d735">

                <pb facs="0606" n="490" xml:id="pg490"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 1230s4/123.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé O’Shaughnessy to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-25T13:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1914, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Arrived safely by special train last night. I transmit below translation of note
                    tendered me by Foreign Office, breaking off relations; also my reply
                    thereto.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Shaughnessy</hi></signed>.</closer>



